WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.890
Have you ever wondered about the deepest desire
of SCP-2598, or the Traveling Moth Salesman?

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:12.759
Foundation researchers snapped a photo of
SCP-2598 using SCP-978, or the Desire Camera,

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:16.689
while it was circling the lighting implement
in its containment cell, and this was the

00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:17.689
result:

00:00:17.689 --> 00:00:21.220
"Subject is standing in front of a miniature
house with another, smaller moth.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.999
Both subjects appear to be wearing small helmets."

00:00:23.999 --> 00:00:28.179
It seems as though the Moth Salesman wants
nothing more than to be at home, with its

00:00:28.179 --> 00:00:29.179
family.

00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:34.770
Sadly, while it is in the custody of the SCP
Foundation, this dream is just that: only

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:35.269
a dream.

